# Wireshark coloring rules for the case. Import via
# View > Coloring Rules > Import, or copy this folder into your Wireshark
# profiles directory as "detective-green". First match wins.
@Retransmission (the smoking gun)@tcp.analysis.retransmission || tcp.analysis.fast_retransmission@[65535,20560,20560][0,0,0]
@Duplicate ACK (receiver still waiting)@tcp.analysis.duplicate_ack@[65535,50372,20560][0,0,0]
@ICMP frag-needed (never arrives)@icmp.type == 3 && icmp.code == 4@[40092,20560,65535][65535,65535,65535]
@Full-size segment@tcp.len >= 1300@[51400,51400,65535][0,0,0]
@Handshake@tcp.flags.syn == 1@[45232,65535,45232][0,0,0]
@TCP@tcp@[59110,59110,59110][0,0,0]
